amcinematics.ritual.livro.texto=Binds you to the surrounding world. !l !l Grants 80,000 maximum mana, 50 percent faster mana recovery, 1,000 burnout with doubled recovery and, on grass or dirt under the open sky, 25 percent more recovery: the world feeds you. Those who did the old ritual may do this one. !l !l Requires magic level %s and the final blow on the Water and Earth Guardians. !l !l The central emerald block must see the sky, with exposed dirt or grass around it. Night is not required. !l !l Drop next to the emerald:
amcinematics.ritual.livro.ativacao=Build the circle, then sneak and touch the central emerald block with the %s. The world will test you three times: fail and the reagents are lost (the Orb returns) and you are Silenced. The chat lists anything missing.
